      "episodeCount": 14,
      "name": "Season 4",
      "overview": "This season follows the same intellectual style as before. Guests team up to solve puzzles in themed escape rooms. With no time limits, they take on different roles and compete with amateur players in intelligence, creativity, decision-making, and teamwork. Overcoming challenges together, they escape the rooms, building unity and sharing values like cooperation and perseverance. The show also uses role-playing to reflect real-world issues, highlighting human kindness and sincerity.",
      "posterPath": "/wXYHSFYxPuHUiAdD3SdKxIUUxmh.jpg",
      "seasonNumber": 4
    },
    {
      "airDate": "2023-06-14",
      "episodeCount": 14,
      "name": "Season 5",
      "overview": "Great Escape S5 is an intelligence-based, real-life puzzle-solving interactive variety show. The program showcases high-IQ youth engaging in diverse confrontations and puzzle-solving, ultimately overcoming numerous difficulties to embody the spirit of teamwork and mutual assistance.",
      "posterPath": "/qvJ2Sq7pPvooH04UN2UBufG5uBy.jpg",
      "seasonNumber": 5
    },
    {
      "airDate": "2024-07-31",
      "episodeCount": 13,
      "name": "Season 6",
      "overview": "This season, the Great Escape team forms a \"Special Investigation Unit\" with six members who gain unique abilities. They explore six fantastical legends of the Escape Planet, uncovering hidden truths. The themes blend reality with urban myths, as players brave terrifying real-life mazes, relying on teamwork and courage. With new open-ended challenges, they experience personal growth—and unexpected twists.",
      "posterPath": "/3q1Ypqw5cV1hxsBhYdbr9zv3ttR.jpg",
      "seasonNumber": 6
    },
    {
      "airDate": "2025-07-09",
      "episodeCount": 13,
      "name": "Season 7",
      "overview": "A large-scale real-life puzzle show produced by MangoTV. This “Survivor Season” features more challenging and suspenseful escape scenarios. Contestants must summon all their courage, intelligence, and potential to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and push their limits to succeed",
      "posterPath": "/yq6gJUXCFimaq1V8zvA27R2eODW.jpg",
      "seasonNumber": 7
    },
    {
      "airDate": "2026-07-22",
      "episodeCount": 25,
      "name": "Season 8",
      "overview": "Great Escape S8 is upgraded with new mechanics and immersive gameplay, setting a new standard for infinite-style escape challenges. The team is pulled into multiple game worlds, moving between a base and different escape rooms to find the real exit. Each room has unique rules, requiring both teamwork and competition. Who can escape, and what truth lies behind this endless world?",
      "posterPath": "/t3r5eqxwONYs5AQqhxd4uZp7aOI.jpg",
